   1. Parity Validation: divergence < 0.01% (owner: metrics-lead)
   2. Latency & Performance SLO: p99 ≤ 100ms (owner: performance-lead)
   3. Reliability & Error Rates: 5xx ≤ 0.01% (owner: ops-lead)
   4. Memory & Resource Utilization: heap ≤ 256MB stable (owner: performance-lead)
   5. Audit Trail & Compliance: logs complete, rotated to B2 (owner: audit-lead)
   6. Team & Infrastructure Readiness: fire-drill pass, on-call trained (owner: ops-lead)
   7. Go/No-Go Decision Gate: platform-lead + owner + ops-lead consensus (owner: platform-lead)"

